@conversation index id=cvn_qxfOhN chapter=Prologue title="A Quiet Evening" checkpoint
@scene VN day=0 time=21:00 bg=bg_sitting_room.png music=sunny.mp3

narration
  en: A quiet evening at Nora's place. Your phone has been buzzing all day, all from your old number.

nora:smile [center] voice=vo_nora_01.mp3
  en: Hey! You're finally here.

input NAME default=Alex by=nora
  en: Nora squints at you. "Remind me, what should I call you?"

nora:smile
  en: Nice to e-meet you {{NAME}} 🙏 ...kidding. Sit down.
  set met_nora true

nora:open
  en: So you got a new number, but someone keeps texting the old one?

choice CURIOSITY by=nora
  en: "Are you going to check it?"
? Yeah, let me look.
  value eager
  +curiosity 5
  -> day1
? Nah. Probably spam.
  value wary

nora:frown voice=vo_nora_02.mp3 [if CURIOSITY == 'wary']
  en: Your phone is buzzing again. You should really look.

wait 1.5s
  en: New message from an unknown number

-> day1
